{"homeColumns":"4","homeGutter":"12","homeBg":"","works":[{"id":"sing-to-the-moon","title":"Sing to the MOON","caption":"Creative Development／Digital Experience／Packaging Design","thumbnail":"/uploads/sing-to-the-moon-card.jpg","thumbnailAlt":"Sing to the MOON 中秋禮盒，唱盤造型的包裝","tags":["Packaging","UI/UX","Web Design","Motion Graphics"],"year":"2024","client":"MX 創意思境","seoTitle":"Sing to the MOON 中秋禮盒","seoDesc":"結合 AI 專屬歌曲與實體禮盒的中秋企劃：數位介面、網站動態與唱盤造型包裝設計。","description":"A Gift That Sings Your Story","modules":[{"type":"module_a","headline":"如果一份禮物，能唱出專屬於你的故事呢？","body":"送禮，除了傳遞心意，也可以成為一段值得記住的體驗。\n\n以中秋節為起點，這次企劃將音樂、個人化內容與節日送禮結合，透過 AI 生成專屬歌曲、生命靈數等概念，探索傳統節慶禮盒更多有趣的可能性。","columns":"1","textAlign":"left","gutter":"default","bg":"","images":[{"src":"/uploads/sing-to-the-moon-gift-box.jpg","alt":"Sing to the MOON 禮盒：掃描 QR code、個人黑膠唱盤、手工瓷盤與聲波擴音座"}]},{"type":"module_a","headline":"The Concept","body":"從前期創意發想到視覺發展，我們嘗試讓禮盒不只是一組節慶商品，而是一段可以參與、探索與分享的體驗。\n\n我參與了前期的共同概念發想，並將企劃方向延伸至數位介面與包裝設計，讓線上的互動體驗與實體禮盒之間，形成一致的創意語言。","columns":"1","textAlign":"left","gutter":"default","bg":"","images":[{"src":"/uploads/sing-to-the-moon-web.jpg","alt":"Sing to the MOON 網站在筆電與手機上的畫面"}]},{"type":"module_a","headline":"Beyond the Box","body":"除了數位介面的視覺與動態設計，我也負責禮盒的包裝結構與整體視覺發展。\n\n從包裝如何開啟、內容物如何配置，到盤子的挑選與搭配，都希望讓每個細節不只是功能性的安排，也能延續整體概念。\n\n而網站本身也是這次作品體驗的一部分：從畫面、動態到內容呈現，讓線上與線下的設計彼此呼應。","columns":"1","textAlign":"left","gutter":"default","bg":"","images":[{"src":"/uploads/sing-to-the-moon-results.jpg","alt":"收到禮盒的人留下的回饋"},{"src":"/uploads/sing-to-the-moon-results-2.jpg","alt":"成果數據：80 份限量實體禮盒、1526 首生成歌曲、7923 次點擊互動、1092 次主動分享"}]},{"type":"module_a","headline":"My Contribution","body":"參與前期共同創意發想，負責數位介面設計、網站動態效果、禮盒包裝結構與視覺設計，以及作品網站的整體設計與製作。\n\n*本專案由團隊共同發展創意方向；企劃文案由企劃夥伴撰寫，盤子則與企劃夥伴共同挑選。*","columns":"0","textAlign":"left","gutter":"default","bg":"","images":[]}],"subtitle":"中秋禮盒｜唱盤造型包裝、互動網站、AI 專屬歌曲"},{"id":"daan-eco-fair","title":"大安森林公園生態嘉年華","caption":"Key Visual／Illustration","thumbnail":"/uploads/daan-eco-fair-card.jpg","thumbnailAlt":"2024 大安森林公園生態嘉年華 ECO FAIR 主視覺","tags":["Illustration","Exhibition"],"year":"2024","seoTitle":"大安森林公園生態嘉年華 主視覺","seoDesc":"2024 大安森林公園「30而立 自然正成長」生態嘉年華 ECO FAIR 主視覺與周邊視覺設計，團隊專案，獲 2025 DesignBIZ 永續實踐獎。","description":"2024「30而立 自然正成長」生態嘉年華 ECO FAIR","modules":[{"type":"module_a","headline":"2025 DesignBIZ 永續實踐獎","body":"大安森林公園 30 週年的生態嘉年華活動視覺。主辦單位為大安森林公園之友基金會，由 MX 創意思境團隊執行。\n\n本專案為團隊獲獎專案，我參與主視覺與周邊視覺設計。","columns":"1","textAlign":"left","gutter":"default","bg":"","images":[{"src":"/uploads/daan-eco-fair-key-visual.jpg","alt":"2024 大安森林公園生態嘉年華 ECO FAIR 主視覺，以公園裡的植物、鳥類、昆蟲與魚類插畫組成"}]}],"services":["BRAND","DISPLAY"],"subtitle":"生態活動｜主視覺與插畫設計（團隊獲獎專案）"},{"id":"ee-branding","title":"E.e Branding","caption":"Branding","thumbnail":"/uploads/3b1007_d18776d9781e42249b4269436cd5b07e~mv2.jpg","thumbnailAlt":"E.e Branding 品牌識別系統設計","tags":["Branding"],"seoTitle":"","seoDesc":"","modules":[{"type":"module_b","columns":"1","gutter":"default","bg":"","images":[{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-01.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-02.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-03.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-04.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-05.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-06.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-07.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-08.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-09.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-10.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-11.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-12.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-13.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-14.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-15.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-16.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-17.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-18.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-19.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-20.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-21.jpg","alt":""},{"src":"/uploads/ee-branding-22.jpg"